[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18421.83, "timestamp": "05:07:01", "text": "限制。除了N先生之外，不需要其他人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18424.23, "timestamp": "05:07:04", "text": "那里没什么有趣的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18426.628, "timestamp": "05:07:06", "text": "清洁、除尘"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18428.868, "timestamp": "05:07:08", "text": "每天。你根本不明白。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18431.43, "timestamp": "05:07:11", "text": "习惯。就像我清洁的方式一样填充"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18434.07, "timestamp": "05:07:14", "text": "这里每天都在，或者说普赛克是如何浇灌她的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18435.91, "timestamp": "05:07:15", "text": "一天两次送花。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18438.07, "timestamp": "05:07:18", "text": "习惯填补了内心的空虚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18440.31, "timestamp": "05:07:20", "text": "他看起来很自律。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18443.99, "timestamp": "05:07:23", "text": "亨里克先生，在削苹果皮的时候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18446.948, "timestamp": "05:07:26", "text": "果皮不能破。步数"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18449.35, "timestamp": "05:07:29", "text": "从洗澡开始，这些习惯就相当……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18451.27, "timestamp": "05:07:31", "text": "不过，这是个人原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18454.31, "timestamp": "05:07:34", "text": "所以，亨里克经常能逃脱……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18457.59, "timestamp": "05:07:37", "text": "晚上8点到家每月20日。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18470.948, "timestamp": "05:07:50", "text": "你好，米娅。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18473.19, "timestamp": "05:07:53", "text": "你不仅离开了我，这一切都结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18474.868, "timestamp": "05:07:54", "text": "正确的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18476.55, "timestamp": "05:07:56", "text": "嗯？"}]